<title>BELGIUM: EU Commission approves Luxembourg farm aid scheme.</title>
<headline>EU Commission approves Luxembourg farm aid scheme.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-10-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Commission has approved part of an aid scheme under a Luxembourg plan to preserve the countryside, it said in a statement.</p>
<p>The national aid and the Community aid together total 47,000 Luxembourg francs per hectare, the statement said.</p>
<p>The Commission has also approved national finance under the scheme for the upkeep of vineyards to improve production methods compatible with preserving the countryside.</p>
</text>
